# Retired spelling: `colw` was renamed `width`. The migration
# error fires wherever the old keyword appears — outside a block as well as
# inside one — so an old document never fails with a vague "unknown keyword".
figdown 0.1 table
colw auto 90
table t "T"
| A | B |
|---|---|
| 1 | 2 |
colw auto 90
